{"text": "The owner stared at the note in wonder, and he said that he could not change it but I could pay him any time. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I rushed back to the brothers house to correct their mistake, but a servant told me that they had gone to the Continent. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Then I read the letter, which said that the money was lent to me for thirty days without interest. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> At the end of the month I was to report back, and if the writer won, I would get any position I could fill. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The letter had no signature, no address, and no date, so I had no way to return the note. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I could not afford new clothes, for I had nothing in the world but a million pounds. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Still, I went into a tailors shop and asked for a cheap suit, and a clerk named Tod gave me one with a sneer. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> When I handed him the note, his smile froze, and the owner of the shop came running to see what was wrong. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The owner scolded Tod for selling a millionaire such a terrible suit, and he measured me for the finest clothes in the shop. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> I did warn him that he might have to wait a long time for his money, but he said that he would gladly wait forever.", "alignment": {"characters": ["T", "h", "e", " ", "o", "w", "n", "e", "r", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "n", "o", "t", "e", " ", "i", "n", " ", "w", "o", "n", "d", "e", "r", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "h", "e", " ", "s", "a", "i", "d", " ", "t", "h", "a", "t", " ", "h", "e", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "c", "h", "a", "n", "g", "e", " ", "i", "t", " ", "b", "u", "t", " ", "I", " ", "c", "o", "u", "l", "d", " ", "p", "a", "y", " ", "h", "i", "m", " ", "a", "n", "y", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "I", " ", 